# Flyback demo reel: 16 s at 60 fps, the five machines in turn.
#     hvtest --film 960 --size 1280x720 --script docs/demo.cues \
#       | ffmpeg -f rawvideo -pix_fmt rgba -s 1280x720 -r 60 -i - -pix_fmt yuv420p demo.mp4
#
# Tracks are held before their first key and interpolated BETWEEN keys, so a
# dropdown changes on a pair of keys a frame apart (`179 Machine 1 / 180
# Machine 0`), and a button press is three keys (`29 Fire 0 / 30 Fire 1 /
# 31 Fire 0`) -- without the key before, the value would ramp and cross 0.5
# halfway there.
#
# Everything runs on Preset 0 (Custom). A Preset other than Custom is laid
# over the controls at read time (source/Presets.h) and its row includes BPS,
# Belt Current, Branching, Gas and Sphere Finish, so a sweep of any of them
# under a preset changes nothing on screen (this file's BPS sweep did exactly
# that until it moved to Custom). Each machine's preset row is copied in by
# hand instead: Machine, Supply, Glow, Persistence and Gas are the columns
# that differ between the five rows; every other column is the constructor's
# default in all of them.

0    Preset       0

# 0-3 s: the Tesla coil (row: Machine 1, Supply NST, Glow 0.45, Persistence
# 0.30, Air), the interrupter sweeping up from 30 to 400 BPS: the streamers
# lengthen as the channel stays hot between bangs.
0    Machine      1
0    Supply       1
0    Glow         0.45
0    Persistence  0.30
0    Gas          0
0    BPS          0.3
90   BPS          0.3
170  BPS          0.85
179  BPS          0.85

# 3-6 s: the Jacob's ladder (Machine 0, NST, Glow 0.50, Persistence 0.10),
# climbing, bowing, snapping at L*, restriking. BPS back to the rows' 120.
179  Machine      1
180  Machine      0
180  BPS          0.6078
179  Glow         0.45
180  Glow         0.50
179  Persistence  0.30
180  Persistence  0.10

# 6-9 s: the Van de Graaff (Machine 2, NST, Glow 0.50, Persistence 0.40),
# polished: no corona, a spark every C V_b / I. Fired once more by hand at 7.5 s.
359  Machine      0
360  Machine      2
359  Persistence  0.10
360  Persistence  0.40
449  Fire         0
450  Fire         1
451  Fire         0

# 9-12.5 s: the plasma globe (Machine 3, Flyback supply, Glow 0.55,
# Persistence 0.30, neon-xenon); a finger on the glass at 10.5 s pulls the
# filaments together.
539  Machine      2
540  Machine      3
539  Supply       1
540  Supply       2
539  Glow         0.50
540  Glow         0.55
539  Persistence  0.40
540  Persistence  0.30
539  Gas          0
540  Gas          3
540  Finger       0
629  Finger       0
630  Finger       1
540  Finger X     0.62
540  Finger Y     0.78

# 12.5-16 s: a Lichtenberg figure (Machine 4, ZVS, Glow 0.40, Persistence
# 0.30, Air) growing, and a fresh one at 14.5 s.
749  Machine      3
750  Machine      4
749  Supply       2
750  Supply       0
749  Glow         0.55
750  Glow         0.40
749  Gas          3
750  Gas          0
869  Fire         0
870  Fire         1
871  Fire         0
